{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38120","headline":"赠湖南李思齐处士 · 韩偓","name":"赠湖南李思齐处士","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"两板船头浊酒壶，七丝琴畔白髭须。\n三春日日黄梅雨，孤客年年青草湖。\n燕侠冰霜难狎近，楚狂锋刃触凡愚。\n知余绝粒窥仙事，许到名山看药鑪。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韩偓","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_38120.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38120","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}